    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Eka",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117798267602681196089/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUs5Jp9u34H0bH9hxzl8H6XLm-xK0g71_oiNn3o81DXTjszXKU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "This store is a paradise for craft lovers! It has an incredible selection of knitting yarns in every color and texture imaginable, along with a vast assortment of beads and all the supplies needed for handicrafts. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced crafter, you'll find everything you need for your creative projects. The quality of the materials is excellent, and the variety is impressive. On top of that, the staff is friendly, knowledgeable, and always ready to help with advice or recommendations. A must-visit for anyone passionate about knitting, beading, or handmade crafts!",
        "time": 1738596611,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "laraalouu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110658842611911640529/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-nUZ69ocmGSJAdFSv2rVodSuCbCBwJFXsivBvO_88P3YXJ6NN=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Your cashiers should know to not let a client wait. I waited about 15 minutes in line to pay for 3 things because your cashier did not want to call anyone else to help her at cash when she clearly saw me waiting. Instead I get glared at when I leave the store that I spent money at. I understand you want to give your clients time to pay but it’s not very courteous to keep your other clients waiting because of it.",
        "time": 1756421345,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maria Joao Sa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117081538647009476819/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUjjQsY8Lyb55ZGpKbU9xhd63nru7AghMrMVynMp01frXl0A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Its good but I was surprised they don't have those rolls of 500 \"Thank you\" stickers; its just a small package with a few stickers. 😪",
        "time": 1763878637,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "S Lee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110227110373309060724/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUh-cVIZQXccBYaKbnJDgci8oZZngrU3U44O_DBT9QmRlLIPs1a=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Nice store but I found the yarn department a bit small and yarn prices seem to have gone up.  Makes for an expensive hobby now unfortunately. Was lucky to have gone when there was a sale though!  Managed to snag a few skeins. The employees were kind and polite.  Store is fairly bright and easy to move around in, good variety of craft supplies.  Didn't have enough time to explore at my leisure since we arrived close to closing time.",
        "time": 1739630264,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nicolas G.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103521018403691589419/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXuZffi_dzOxrectJ9i_QSWeHFW3YJMf43qPD25n1V50PCBXZRa=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "A go-to spot for all things creative!\nMichaels in Vaudreuil is consistently a great experience. The store has a wide and well-organized selection of arts, crafts, home décor, and seasonal items—I almost always find exactly what I need, whether it's for a project, a gift, or just some inspiration.\n\nThe staff here are friendly, knowledgeable, and always willing to help, which makes the shopping experience even better. Whether you're a seasoned crafter or just getting started, this location is a reliable place to stock up and get inspired.",
